  "description": "FlowMediator is an opinionated mediator library for explicit application flow in .NET 8 and .NET 9.\n\n      It provides clear separation between request-based application flow (SendAsync)\n      and event-based side effects (PublishAsync), with pipeline support for CQRS-style\n      applications and explicit event handling.",
  "id": "FlowMediator",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-01-26T19:01:09.803Z",
